{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_flux_x",
    "description": "The zonal PPM layer-flux lowering rule of the mom6_cgrid: matches the user rewrite target mom6_cgrid_flux_x(h, u_E, dy_Cu_E, mask, h_min_recon, dt, IdxT, IdxT_e) — the east-face layer volume flux of every cell — and emits the [i,j,k] makearray of the MOM6 zonal flux law (zonal_flux_layer, MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:933-956, VOL_CFL=False, por_face_areaU = 1): uh(i,j,k) = dy_Cu_E(i,j,k) * u_E(i,j,k) * (the PPM parabola integral of the UPWIND cell's limited edges), with the PPM_limit_pos-limited reconstruction of the upwind cell built inline from the stencil laws mom6_ppm_slope/edge/limit_scale/limited_edge/face_integral. The sign of the face velocity selects the upwind cell: u_E > 0 upwinds the cell itself (the F90:933-939 branch: CFL = u*dt*IdxT(i,j), uh = dy*u*(h_E(i) + CFL*(0.5*(h_W(i) - h_E(i)) + curv_3*(CFL - 1.5)))), u_E < 0 upwinds the east neighbor (the F90:940-949 branch: CFL = -u*dt*IdxT_e(i,j), uh = dy*u*(h_W(i+1) + CFL*(0.5*(h_E(i+1) - h_W(i+1)) + curv_3*(CFL - 1.5)))), and u_E == 0 gives the trivial zero flux. The reconstruction reads h and the mask over the 6-cell stencil i-2..i+3 of the face; the index expressions CLAMP at the domain edges (max(1, i-2), max(1, i-1) low, min(N_I, i+2), min(N_I, i+3) high) so the lowered operator is total on the traced subdomain — the halo closure is a well-definedness device only: the pinned interior faces (i >= 3, i <= N_I-2) never read a clamped index, so the stage-2 pins compare the rule against the Fortran's halo-updated values bit-for-bit. The EAST DOMAIN WALL is an explicit region: the face at i = N_I (the east edge of the last cell column) carries the zero flux of a solid wall (the Fortran's masked face: u = 0 and the convergence (uh(i,j) - uh(i-1,j))*IareaT then telescopes to -uh(N_I-1)*IareaT in the sibling mom6_cgrid_div_x). The masked-cell handling is inside the stencil laws (zero slope and the masked-neighbor edge replacement of PPM_reconstruction_x, F90:2380-2449). The consuming model spells uh = mom6_cgrid_flux_x(h, u_E, dy_Cu_E, mask, h_min_recon, dt, IdxT, IdxT_e) with h [i,j,k], u_E/dy_Cu_E/IdxT/IdxT_e [i,j,k], mask [i,j] and the scalars h_min_recon/dt (esm-spec 9.6.1: non-param strings in the match are literal per-variable selectors, so the rule fires only on THIS operator with exactly these argument variables).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:advection",
      "order:3",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k",
      "spec:9.6.8"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Lin, S.-J. (1994). A nearly conservative flux-reconstruction scheme. Monthly Weather Review, 122(5), 994-1011. (The monotonic slope constraint, Eq. B2.)"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_slope.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_edge.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_limit_scale.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_limited_edge.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_face_integral.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_flux_x": {
      "params": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"],
      "priority": 10,
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_flux_x",
        "args": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"]
      },
      "where": {
        "h": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "u_E": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "dy_Cu_E": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "mask": { "shape": ["i", "j"] },
        "IdxT": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "IdxT_e": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": [1, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": ">",
                  "args": [
                    { "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    0.0
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_ppm_face_integral",
                  "bindings": {
                    "u": { "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "dt": "dt",
                    "dy": { "op": "index", "args": ["dy_Cu_E", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "I_dx": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxT", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "h_face": {
                      "op": "apply_expression_template",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "mom6_ppm_limited_edge",
                      "bindings": {
                        "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                        "scale": {
                          "op": "apply_expression_template",
                          "args": [],
                          "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale",
                          "bindings": {
                            "hL_raw": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "slp_side": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "slp_0": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "m_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] }
                              }
                            },
                            "hR_raw": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "slp_side": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "slp_0": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "m_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                              }
                            },
                            "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                            "h_min_recon": "h_min_recon"
                          }
                        },
                        "raw": {
                          "op": "apply_expression_template",
                          "args": [],
                          "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
                          "bindings": {
                            "h_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                            "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                            "slp_side": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                              }
                            },
                            "slp_0": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] },
                                "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] }
                              }
                            },
                            "m_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "h_back": {
                      "op": "apply_expression_template",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "mom6_ppm_limited_edge",
                      "bindings": {
                        "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                        "scale": {
                          "op": "apply_expression_template",
                          "args": [],
                          "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale",
                          "bindings": {
                            "hL_raw": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "slp_side": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "slp_0": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "m_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] }
                              }
                            },
                            "hR_raw": {
                              "op": "apply_expression_template",
                              "args": [],
                              "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
                              "bindings": {
                                "h_side": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                "slp_side": {
                                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                                  "args": [],
                                  "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
                                  "bindings": {
                                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] }
                                  }
                                },
                                "slp_0": {
